---
const TALK_URL = "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mQWsm7AVbCM";
---

<div class="intro">
  <p>
    <em>Building startups in Italy.</em> 20 y/o founding engineer at{" "}
    <a href="https://datapizza.tech">Datapizza</a>, the biggest AI deployment
    company in Italy. We raised a €10M Series A to scale it across the country.
  </p>
  <p>
    I love software architecture, distributed systems and{" "}
    <a href="https://effect.website">Effect</a>.{" "}
    <a href={TALK_URL} class="video" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M23.5 6.19a3.02 3.02 0 0 0-2.12-2.14C19.5 3.55 12 3.55 12 3.55s-7.5 0-9.38.5A3.02 3.02 0 0 0 .5 6.19C0 8.07 0 12 0 12s0 3.93.5 5.81a3.02 3.02 0 0 0 2.12 2.14c1.88.5 9.38.5 9.38.5s7.5 0 9.38-.5a3.02 3.02 0 0 0 2.12-2.14C24 15.93 24 12 24 12s0-3.93-.5-5.81zM9.55 15.57V8.43L15.82 12l-6.27 3.57z"></path>
      </svg>
      My talk at Effect Milan
    </a>
    .
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .intro {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space);
  }

  .video svg {
    width: 1em;
    height: 1em;
    margin-right: 0.375em;
    vertical-align: -0.125em;
    fill: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
